WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,960
If you lose, can you not be dejected?

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,840
They all want to respect the opponents in the secret realm

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,040
The Son of God alone defeated them all

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,200
Even if you don’t accept it, you have to admit it.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,120
This is just a player from Shentang

6
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,440
Each of the three parties sent ten people

7
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,760
At least nine geniuses on the same level as the Son of God have entered the secret realm.

8
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,800
No one will listen to us explain resources and background

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,720
If you can't win, you can't win.

10
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,640
What's this

11
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,800
Believers in the Divine Hall, Millions of Disciples

12
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,160
There were only two sons of gods.

13
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,000
Throw the resources provided by the shrine on you

14
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,180
You are better than him

15
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,330
Don't judge yourself as a loser now

16
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:31,290
Ouch, I love what this big brother says.

17
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:33,170
Just by looking at you, you won’t be able to please your own president.

18
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,690
I made my old man happy before going out

19
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,690
The old man was so happy that he gave me his trump card.

20
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:39,500
I can at least ask the Son of God to compete with him for half his life

21
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,990
coaxed early

22
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,510
I invite the old man to drink

23
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:44,910
I arranged eight waiters for him while he was drunk.

24
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:47,190
Then turning around and going back to the palace will blow his insurance.

25
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,500
Drain them all

26
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,860
Where are we going?
